# What docker/Dockerfile takes from the repository: the code, its scripts and release keys, the load generator's
# source and docker/pins.py. Nothing else reaches an image: no git history, environments, tests or local builds.
**
!pyproject.toml
!LICENSE
!README.md
!src/
!scripts/
!release/
!native/loadgen/
!docker/pins.py
native/loadgen/target/
src/verathos/throughput/verathos-loadgen
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info/
